<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Water Resupply Order - Street Food Vendors</title>
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Water Resupply for Street Food Vendors</h1>
      <p>
        Running low on water? Order your essential supplies quickly and easily
        to keep your stall running smoothly!
      </p>

      <div class="product-grid">
        <div class="product-card">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1549247738-4e390c2a5135?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400&h=200&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1yZWxhdGVkfDJ8fHxlbnwwfHx8fHwxNzIwNTcwNTE3fDA&ixlib=rb-4.0.3"
            alt="20 Liter Water Bottle"
            class="product-image"
          />
          <div class="product-info">
            <h2>20 Liter Water Bottle</h2>
            <p>
              Standard size for daily operations. High-quality purified drinking
              water for all your needs.
            </p>
            <div class="price">₹70.00</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="product-card">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1596765796030-ff6f991f8931?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400&h=200&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1yZWxhdGVkfDV8fHxlbnwwfHx8fHwxNzIwNTcwNTE3fDA&ixlib=rb-4.0.3"
            alt="200 Liter Water Drum"
            class="product-image"
          />
          <div class="product-info">
            <h2>200 Liter Water Drum</h2>
            <p>
              Bulk supply for busy vendors or multiple stalls. Ideal for
              extensive cooking and cleaning tasks.
            </p>
            <div class="price">₹650.00</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="product-card">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1627092120017-d2b516147496?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400&h=200&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1yZWxhdGVkfDE3fHx8ZW58MHx8fHx8MTcyMDU3MDQ3OXww&ixlib=rb-4.0.3"
            alt="5 Liter Pack of 6 Bottles"
            class="product-image"
          />
          <div class="product-info">
            <h2>5 Liter (Pack of 6)</h2>
            <p>
              Convenient smaller bottles for easy handling and quick refills,
              perfect for drinking water.
            </p>
            <div class="price">₹210.00</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="product-card">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600869353916-b186b51c8810?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400&h=200&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1yZWxhdGVkfDF8fHxlbnwwfHx8fHwxNzIwNTcwNTE3fDA&ixlib=rb-4.0.3"
            alt="Water Purification Tablets"
            class="product-image"
          />
          <div class="product-info">
            <h2>Water Purification Tablets</h2>
            <p>
              Emergency purification for any water source. Essential for
              contingency planning. (Pack of 100)
            </p>
            <div class="price">₹120.00</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="order-form">
        <h2>Place Your Order</h2>
        <form id="orderForm" action="#" method="POST">
          <label for="water-type">Select Water Product:</label>
          <select id="water-type" name="water_type" required>
            <option value="">-- Please Select --</option>
            <option value="20L">20 Liter Water Bottle</option>
            <option value="200L">200 Liter Water Drum</option>
            <option value="5L_pack">5 Liter (Pack of 6)</option>
            <option value="purification_tabs">
              Water Purification Tablets
            </option>
          </select>

          <label for="quantity">Quantity:</label>
          <input
            type="number"
            id="quantity"
            name="quantity"
            min="1"
            value="1"
            required
          />

          <button type="submit">Place Order</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
      <p>&copy; 2025 Street Food Supplies. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>For urgent deliveries, please call: +91 98765 43210</p>
    </footer>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
